{"id":"n77891-1-7","stage":5,"title":"잔인하다 · 残忍","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77891-1-7-1","ko":"이제 이 모든 일은 네가 스스로 알아서 해.","zh":"现在这些事情都得你自己想办法处理了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}},{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일은","audio":"/audio/b9e5f14a07245bf00ebf.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"스스로","meaning":"自己，亲自","explanation":"스스로：自己，亲自","readings":[{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62476","senseId":"1","lemma":"스스로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4